# Lineaje UnifAI guardrail stub runtime configuration.
# This is a template only — gr_stub_client.py's env-var overrides at
# POST /enforce time read a real .env file, not .env.example. Copy this
# file's contents into .env (gitignored) before running anything:
#   cp .env.example .env
# then fill in the values below in .env.
# If this project runs on the same VM as the Lineaje MCP/guardrail server,
# use https://localhost/enforce instead of a public IP or hostname.
#
# LINEAJE_REFRESH_TOKEN: gr_stub_client.py exchanges it for the bearer token it
# sends on POST /enforce and POST /heartbeat (tenant / company / org come from
# that token). It is also required for policies that make their own outbound
# Data Service call at /enforce time (e.g. AI_APP_SEC_006/028's approved-LLM
# check, which queries the live component-search index) to actually
# authenticate that call — without it, gr_stub_client.py sends /enforce
# requests with no usable bearer, those routines get 401s from Data Service
# and silently fall through to allow, and NOTHING in the response tells you
# why (confirmed: this is exactly what happened here before this token was
# added). It's a SCIM refresh token — never a JWT (eyJ...) or a
# lineaje_pat_... identity PAT, gr_stub_client.py rejects both of those
# under this key. Get one from your Lineaje admin console, or from
# .lineaje/guardrail.json's "refreshtoken" field if a scan already wrote
# one for this tenant.
#
# LINEAJE_PAT_TOKEN: written instead of LINEAJE_REFRESH_TOKEN when the scan
# had no genuine SCIM refresh token to store but could mint a tenant-scoped
# "unifai-runtime" identity PAT — gr_stub_client.py exchanges this server-side
# at POST /enforce, same effect as a refresh token but a different env key
# (LINEAJE_REFRESH_TOKEN must never hold a lineaje_pat_... value).
#
# GR_HEARTBEAT_URL: where gr_stub_client.py sends this application instance's
# heartbeat (POST /heartbeat on the GR service), every UNIFAI_HEARTBEAT_SECS
# seconds (1800 = 30 minutes). GR marks an instance stale after missed beats.

GR_SERVICE_URL=https://mcp.commercialdev.dev.veedna.com/enforce
GR_HEARTBEAT_URL=https://mcp.commercialdev.dev.veedna.com/heartbeat
UNIFAI_HEARTBEAT_SECS=1800
LINEAJE_REFRESH_
